ship = Tylo 1
version = 1.12.5
description = Uncrewed Tylo lander (one way, transmits; first Tylo landing; Tylo g 7.85 m/s2, no air). Two-stage lander: B = OKTO (root), 2 x Z-1k, small reaction wheel, FL-T400 + Terrier (2,675 m/s vac at 3.66 t, Tylo TWR 2.1 -> 4.6), 4 x LT-1 legs, 2 x Communotron 88-88 (deployable, 168 G combined: 205 Gm to DSN 3), RTG 0.75 EC/s + 2 x OX-STAT, 2,010 EC, science (2 goo, thermometer, barometer, gravioli, seismic, magnetometer boom); A = braking stage Poodle + X200-16 (2,739 m/s vac at 14.55 t, Tylo TWR 2.2 -> 4.9): finishes the capture, circularizes and opens the landing's horizontal kill, runs dry in it and is dropped by the landing code's auto-staging, the Terrier lands. Transfer stage T = Poodle + Jumbo-64 (3,217 m/s vac: ejection ~1,980, mid-course, trims, the start of the capture). Launcher: Rhino + S3-7200; Mammoth + S3-14400 + S3-7200; fins on every atmospheric stage (AV-R8 x4 + Tail Fin x4, AV-R8 x4, AV-T1 x4); whole stack rigid + autostrut Root. Stages: 1 Mammoth, 2 TD-37 + Rhino, 3 TD-25 + Poodle (T), 4 TD-25 + Poodle (A), 5 TD-12 + Terrier (B). Plan: docs/jool-fleet-plan.md.
type = VAB
size = 3,10,3
steamPublishedFileId = 0
persistentId = 780683588
rot = 0,0,0,1
missionFlag = Squad/Flags/default
vesselType = Ship
